        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/09/iphone-17-model-colors.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>A new Counterpoint Research report shows that the iPhone 17 overtook the iPhone 17 Pro Max and became the world’s best-selling smartphone during the first three months of 2026. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"counterpoint-research,iphone-17\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1050876\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/04/report-iphone-17-ranked-as-worlds-top-selling-smartphone-in-q1-2026/#more-1050876\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
