        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/12/apple-tv-4k-tvos-26-lg.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>We’re still waiting for a <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2025/12/31/new-apple-tv-4k-is-coming-heres-what-the-rumors-say/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1033860\">new Apple TV 4K to launch</a>, but tvOS at least keeps improving, including with five new settings in tvOS 26 for customizing your Apple TV.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,apple-tv-4k,tvos-26\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051161\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/06/tvos-26-has-added-five-new-ways-to-customize-your-apple-tv-4k/#more-1051161\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
