        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/05/leaker-suggests-seven-new-features-coming-to-iphone-20-but-read-with-care/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/06/iPhone-20th-anniversary-mockup-ios26-01.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Leaker Instant Digital has a decent track record when it comes to iPhones, but their latest post may need to be treated with a certain amount of caution.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>They list seven new features we might expect from the 20th anniversary model, but it may be more of a wish list than a leak … </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1050902\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/05/leaker-suggests-seven-new-features-coming-to-iphone-20-but-read-with-care/#more-1050902\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
