        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/carplay-ultra-ios-26-aston.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>CarPlay has improved a lot with iOS 26 and subsequent updates over the past year, here are two new features I’ve been loving lately.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"carplay,ios-26\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051512\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/08/carplay-keeps-getting-better-here-are-two-new-features-ive-been-loving/#more-1051512\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
