        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/07/anthropic-updates-claude-managed-agents-with-three-new-features/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/claude-creative.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Anthropic launched Claude Managed Agents <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/09/anthropic-scales-up-with-enterprise-features-for-claude-cowork-and-managed-agents/\">last month</a>, greatly simplifying the work required to build and deploy cloud-hosted AI agents. This week, Claude Managed Agents are becoming more capable with three new features.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051266\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/07/anthropic-updates-claude-managed-agents-with-three-new-features/#more-1051266\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
