        "title": "iPhone 18 Pro: Three new design updates are coming this year",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/06/iphone-18-pro-three-new-design-updates-are-coming-this-year/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/iphone-18-pro-mockup.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max will <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/17/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-flagship-is-coming/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1048598\">launch this fall</a>, and in addition to packing <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/01/26/iphone-18-pro-six-new-features-are-coming-later-this-year/\">a variety of new features</a>, there are three design changes reportedly coming. Here’s what rumors say to expect.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-18-pro,iphone-18-pro-max\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1038754\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/06/iphone-18-pro-three-new-design-updates-are-coming-this-year/#more-1038754\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
