        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/05/apple-manufacturing-academy-highlights-ai-adoption-across-u-s-industry/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-manufacturing-forum.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple and Michigan State University recently held the inaugural Spring Forum for the Apple Manufacturing Academy, focused on how AI is being implemented across multiple manufacturing workflows. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051065\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/05/apple-manufacturing-academy-highlights-ai-adoption-across-u-s-industry/#more-1051065\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
