        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/09/hypertension-notifications-apple-watch.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>watchOS 26 introduced a new hypertension detection feature not only for Apple Watch Ultra 3 and Series 11, but for select older Apple Watch models too. Here’s how to set it up, and which models are compatible.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-health,apple-watch,watchos-26\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1020268\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/05/how-to-use-apple-watchs-hypertension-feature-in-watchos-26/#more-1020268\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
